  "question": {
    "text": "Two conducting spheres of radii <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> having charges <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively are placed very far apart from each other. Now they are connected to each other by a connecting wire, then there is"
